## Testing Commands

```bash
# Test login
curl -X POST http://localhost:9000/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"alexwaldmann2004@gmail.com","password":"admin"}'

# Get subdomains
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  http://localhost:9000/api/subdomains

# Check subdomain access
curl -X POST http://localhost:9000/api/vpn/check-subdomain-access \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"user_id":"user123","subdomain":"admin"}'
```

